        "TileImage": "$($repository 1a8a827f-932e-49c0-a1b3-e3201795ae19).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47, we are on track to find that guy thanks to your help in sapienza, but we got new problem-Militia. They Kidnapped our scientist and want to got information about us. We got rescued team, but we still need your help. You need to kill a scientist that is very important for militia-Ezba Berg and his bodyguard. You need also kill spotters that are at barn. This is all. Have a good day 47\r\r-Mr Axo",
